  "title": "Personalized Gold Scriptural Monogram Doormat",
  "handle": "personalized-gold-scriptural-monogram-doormat",
  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a warm welcome, blending functional home decor with spiritual expression. Featuring uplifting Bible verses and customizable text, it serves as a daily reminder of faith and values. Designed for both indoor and covered outdoor use, this doormat adds a meaningful touch to any entryway.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalizable with family name, initial, or custom text</li>\n<li>Features inspirational scripture-based designs</li>\n<li>Soft, lightweight, and comfortable underfoot</li>\n<li>Durable for both indoor and covered outdoor placement</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain with simple methods</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool, Polyester fabric, Memory stretch sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Suede</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Gently soak with dry duster cloth, clean stain with water, use hand-held vacuum cleaner, sweep with broom, shake off outdoors, wipe with damp cloth and mild soap, flush with garden hose</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for entrances, front porches, and entryways, making it an ideal accent for welcoming guests. Its durable yet soft construction makes it perfect for adding a personalized and faith-inspired touch to various home settings.</p>",
